---
The data files in public/data/ are derived works and keep their own licences:
- Railway geometry and stations: (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0
  (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright).
- KRL Commuter Line timetable: Open-KRL (https://github.com/open-krl/pipeline),
  CC-BY 4.0, compiled from public KAI Commuter (kci.id) station boards.
- MRT Jakarta, LRT Jakarta, LRT Jabodebek and Skytrain timetables: ShioriLabs
  commute (https://github.com/ShioriLabs/commute), ODbL 1.0.
- Intercity, regional, KA Bandara and KA Feeder timetables: GAPEKA 2026 (the
  official KAI working timetable), parsed with Transport for Bandung's
  Gapeka-parser (https://github.com/transportforbandung/Gapeka-parser).
- Rolling-stock photos in public/img/fleet/: Wikimedia Commons, each under its own
  licence (CC0, CC BY 2.0/4.0, CC BY-SA 4.0) with author and source in ATTRIBUTION.md.
  They are not covered by the MIT licence above.
- Level crossings in public/data/jpl.json: derived from OpenStreetMap, ODbL 1.0
  (c) OpenStreetMap contributors.
